#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:5 9e631d2281af4ce08d790dc6b2300ce3
msgid "Choosing Servo Functions"
msgstr "选择舵机功能"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:7 b07df4d983e045ba96289bd5b6ead78b
msgid ""
"The most fundamental setup for any plane is the servo output functions. Each"
" type of plane frame type will require different servo output functions to "
"controls its motor(s) and control surfaces. Flight boards vary in the number"
" of outputs they support,some with as few as 6 outputs and others with up to"
" 16. Each of these outputs can be configured as needed for your airframe."
msgstr ""
"任何飞机最基本的设置是舵机输出功能。每种飞机机架类型都需要不同的舵机输出功能来控制其电机和控制面。飞控板输出数量各异，有的只有 6 个输出，有的多达 "
"16 个。每个输出均可根据机架需要配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:13 28dd9c9f3931495a88b1c9c88496a85e
msgid "The default outputs for a standard plane frame are very simple:"
msgstr "标准飞机机架的默认输出非常简单："

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:15 dd248833e569436caec4abec72229682
msgid "servo output 1 is aileron"
msgstr "舵机输出 1 为副翼"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:16 f2d5711ada544f198a350e3e96392d63
msgid "servo output 2 is elevator"
msgstr "舵机输出 2 为升降舵"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:17 ed982b212f234ec29a91aef39b4582fd
msgid "servo output 3 is throttle"
msgstr "舵机输出 3 为油门"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:18 a671cda01f724a5785a2e7f92601d6d2
msgid "servo output 4 is rudder"
msgstr "舵机输出 4 为方向舵"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:20 2ebdc66bf4364e8fb74f8fe09dcb222f
msgid ""
"This is fine for many simple aircraft, but will need to be changed if you "
"have elevons, a vtail, flaps or any other more complex setup, such as "
"QuadPlane or Tail-sitter."
msgstr "这对许多简单飞机来说已足够，但若有升降副翼、V 尾、襟翼或其他更复杂的设置（如 QuadPlane 或尾坐机），则需要更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:24 515f186755154f268c1ed12ae59b3595
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:26 56378fbe61d24fc996b35fa4492b0fa9
msgid ""
"Each of the servo output functions is settable with the corresponding "
"SERVOn_FUNCTION parameter. The defaults are:"
msgstr "每个舵机输出功能可通过相应的 SERVOn_FUNCTION 参数设置。默认值为："

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:40 40898327c7a14a4cac0945afe95d618d
msgid "Available Output Functions"
msgstr "可用输出功能"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:42 dc80bc6aa54446a0a70a0a1cbd7de417
msgid ""
"Each of your servo outputs can be configured to a wide range of possible "
"functions. See the Plane Functions section of :ref:`common-rcoutput-mapping`"
" section."
msgstr "每个舵机输出可配置为多种可能的功能。请参阅 :ref:`common-rcoutput-mapping` 章节中的 Plane 功能部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:45 b43bffc1a58f48c094c5e24b4614cd5e
msgid ""
"In addition, there are servo functions for control of internal combustion "
"engines, pass-thru of controls from RC inputs, camera controls, control of "
"motor tilt functions for tilt-rotors and many others. Those functions are "
"also discussed in the :ref:`common-rcoutput-mapping` section."
msgstr ""
"此外，还有用于内燃机控制、RC 输入直通、摄像机控制、倾转旋翼电机倾转功能控制等的舵机功能。这些功能也在 :ref:`common-rcoutput-"
"mapping` 章节中讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:52 4538dbc0fac44fd2952cbb750d06c856
msgid "Controlling Servo Throw, Trim and Reversal"
msgstr "控制舵机行程、微调与反向"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:54 f04d2a95aef042c68f1db8f007b8fb30
msgid ""
"In addition to the function, each servo output also has parameters to "
"control the servo throw, the trim and servo reversal. Normally, no "
"adjustment is needed, but can be modified to match your servo's capabilities"
" and range. While these values can be used to adjust throw and trim center "
"of a flying surface, it is best to do so mechanically. "
":ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>` can be used to fine adjust the TRIM "
"value automatically in flight, instead of manually changing the mechanical "
"trim. NEVER try to trim a plane with the transmitter trims as this will "
"destroy the RC Calibration values (See :ref:`common-radio-control-"
"calibration`)."
msgstr ""
"除功能外，每个舵机输出还有参数用于控制舵机行程、微调和反向。通常不需要调整，但可以修改以匹配舵机的能力和范围。虽然这些值可用于调整飞行面的行程和微调中心，但最好通过机械方式调整。:ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>`"
" 可用于在飞行中自动微调 TRIM 值，而非手动更改机械微调。切勿使用遥控器微调来调整飞机，这会破坏 RC 校准值（参见 :ref:`common-"
"radio-control-calibration`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:60 17d57984c78c4bf2b56a3a2ecbb4109d
msgid ""
"When using reversing ESCs, these values may be needed to be adjusted (See "
":ref:`reverse-thrust-setup` )"
msgstr "使用可逆 ESC 时，可能需要调整这些值（参见 :ref:`reverse-thrust-setup`）"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:62 0a1d9080bca045b1961d0db9166ca20a
msgid "The parameters are:"
msgstr "参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:64 fe95fe2dc139433f86a8da3bde959dce
msgid "SERVOn_MIN is the minimum PWM output value"
msgstr "SERVOn_MIN 为最小 PWM 输出值"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:65 375dc0d469fa41819558527fa0d589f8
msgid "SERVOn_MAX is the maximum PWM output value"
msgstr "SERVOn_MAX 为最大 PWM 输出值"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:66 b248ac6bff80412291b26f7f16d78700
msgid "SERVOn_TRIM is the trim value for output types that have trim"
msgstr "SERVOn_TRIM 为有微调的输出类型的微调值"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:67 2e7ff9d3d34240fe881ec90475901676
msgid "SERVOn_REVERSED controls servo reversal"
msgstr "SERVOn_REVERSED 控制舵机反向"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:69 dcba308e9a2345348c18581a9ee5b330
msgid "For example, if you have:"
msgstr "例如，若您有："

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:82 8e3c50a2ef9148969f49e6c2573052bd
msgid ""
"then that would setup servo output 5 as a reversed left elevon, with a throw"
" from 1000 to 2000, and a trim of 1504."
msgstr "则这将把舵机输出 5 设置为反向左升降副翼，行程从 1000 到 2000，微调为 1504。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:86 69c7515c351348a08787b6b5d2a25cc8
msgid "Multiple Outputs for One Type"
msgstr "同一类型的多个输出"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:88 f6fe36f39b7b4209875e38c77c04518b
msgid ""
"The SERVOn_FUNCTION values can be assigned to any output, and you can have "
"multiple output channels with the same output function. For example, you can"
" have multiple output channels marked as aileron (function 4) and set the "
"throws and trim on each aileron separately. This allows you to trim your "
"left and right ailerons differently to account for differences in servo "
"trim."
msgstr ""
"SERVOn_FUNCTION 值可分配给任意输出，且可以有多个输出通道使用相同的输出功能。例如，可以将多个输出通道标记为副翼（功能 "
"4），并分别设置每个副翼的行程和微调。这允许您分别微调左右副翼以补偿舵机微调差异。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:96 b6ce720935b64798bd26a0f2a94c17fd
msgid "Setup of Specific Aircraft Types"
msgstr "特定机架类型的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:98 bf92f1113dff4cca9b5a8c80f9487c32
msgid ""
"Now that you understand the basics of the servo output functions you should "
"read the guide for your particular type of aircraft."
msgstr "了解舵机输出功能的基础知识后，应阅读针对您特定机架类型的指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:101 3636d89f24734582b71896361fc0ca81
msgid ""
"Before you do that, however, you should make sure you have correctly setup "
"your :ref:`RC inputs <rc-throw-trim>`."
msgstr "但在此之前，应确保已正确设置 :ref:`RC 输入 <rc-throw-trim>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:112 b96a676836e64fa9aa1dd5ae69118df0
msgid ""
"For QuadPlanes, including Tailsitters and Tilt-Rotors, see these sections: "
":ref:`quadplane-support`, :ref:`guide-tailsitter`, :ref:`guide-tilt-rotor`"
msgstr ""
"对于 QuadPlane，包括尾坐机和倾转旋翼，请参阅以下章节：:ref:`quadplane-support`、:ref:`guide-"
"tailsitter`、:ref:`guide-tilt-rotor`"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:114 a16f1a0649d749ce94bc22595fedafec
msgid ""
"You can combine setups for more complex aircraft. So for example, you could "
"setup a vtail tiltrotor quadplane by combining functions from the guides "
"above."
msgstr "可以组合设置以适应更复杂的飞机。例如，可以通过组合上述指南中的功能来设置 V 尾倾转旋翼四旋翼飞机。"

